// `Duration * Int`, `Int * Duration`, and `Duration / Int` are durations (D16, brief B12); `/` rounds toward negative infinity.
Fact window Identified by Duration
Fact factor Identified by Int
Param base : Duration = 10.
+window(3). +factor(4).
?(window * 2 == 6).
?(2 * window == 6).
?(window * factor == 12).
?(window / 2 == 1).
?((0 - window) / 2 == 0 - 2).
?(base * factor / 2 == 20).
?(Current Time + base * 2 == 20).
